My first Archeologist ascension!!  I now have 2 knights, 1 wizard, 1
barbarian, and 1 archeologist for vanilla Nethack 3.4.3.  I also have
1 Valkyrie in vanilla Nethack 3.3.1.

This ascension was rather routine.  I'm not into serious challenges
yet; I want to ascend each role first.  So I did some genociding--mind
flayers and master mind flayers and all L's.  I also did some wishing--
main items were silver dragon scale mail, spellbook of identify, water
walking boots, an extra bag of holding.  And I did die once on the
Astral plane (but I had on an amulet of life saving)

Two items worth noting:

1)  I found a wand of wishing very, very early.  That gave me the
silver dragon scale mail, which got my AC down quickly and the
spellbook of ID, which helped me ID stuff early.

2) I got Grayswandir very, very early.  Twoweapon conduct with this
and a silver sabre gave me a very potent attack.  I note this because
I've died numerous times when I was close to ascending (i.e. post
meeting Rodney).  The reason that I died (at least my belief) is a
lack of offensive power.  I had low AC, was unburdened but was
overwhelmed by the hordes of monsters that come at you thanks to
Rodney and the priests of Moloch.  On this and my previous ascensions,
I had a potent attack and could fight my way through the hordes.

On to another role!!

